---
/**
 * Sample-data warning.
 *
 * Rendered by the layout from a single dataset flag, so it cannot be omitted
 * from one page by forgetting to add it. Not dismissible, and it reserves its
 * own height in normal flow so it causes no layout shift.
 */
---

<div class="preview" role="status">
  <div class="wrap">
    <strong>Preview:</strong> sample data, not real predictions. Every probability on this site is
    generated for layout purposes.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .preview {
    background: var(--colour-caution-surface);
    color: var(--colour-caution);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--colour-hairline);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding: 10px 0;
  }
</style>
